      "author_association": "NONE",
      "body": "According to [this](https://developer.chrome.com/extensions/webRequest) page, the filter that gets passed to `onHeadersReceived` is a `RequestFilter`, which has a `types` property to allow filtering on resource types. Can this be added to electron's `onHeadersReceived` function, which according to [this](https://github.com/electron/electron/blob/master/docs/api/web-request.md), only supports the `urls` filter?",
